                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       APPLY-CC-RATING-0044.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
